{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "API Key 已保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API key saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence 尚未开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence is turned off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch 或健康数据不完整，热量平衡暂为部分结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Watch or health data is incomplete; energy balance is currently partial"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 本机照片识别不上传照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device photo recognition does not upload photos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 本机识别不上传照片。DeepSeek 识别仅在每次确认后发送照片，App 不保留云端副本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device recognition does not upload photos. DeepSeek receives photos only after each confirmation, and the app does not retain a cloud copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 本机识别不可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device recognition unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 端侧模型尚未准备完成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Apple on-device model is not ready yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 端侧照片识别不可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple on-device photo recognition is unavailable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV 导入预览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV import preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CSV 支持稳定营养代码，例如 energy_kcal、protein_g、calcium_mg。导入前会显示未知列、重复项和单位错误。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CSV supports stable nutrient codes such as energy_kcal, protein_g, and calcium_mg. Unknown columns, duplicates, and unit errors are shown before import."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 仅在每次确认后接收所选照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek receives selected photos only after each confirmation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 只用于识别菜品、份量和营养标签文字。每次分析前都会确认照片上传，API 费用由你的账户承担。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek is used only to recognize dishes, portions, and nutrition-label text. Photo upload is confirmed before every analysis, and API charges are billed to your account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 照片识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek photo recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 营养标签识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek nutrition-label recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DeepSeek 识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DeepSeek recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "English category": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English category"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "English name": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "English name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HealthKit 写入仅在 iPhone 上进行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HealthKit writes occur only on iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HealthKit 当前不可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HealthKit is unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSON 不包含本地餐食原图。照片保留在拍摄设备的 App 沙盒中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON does not include local meal photos. Photos remain in the app sandbox on the capturing device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JSON 不包含本地餐食原图；媒体备份 ZIP 同时包含 JSON 和本地照片。DeepSeek Key、HealthKit 原始数据和 iCloud 凭据不会进入备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JSON excludes original meal photos. The media ZIP includes JSON and local photos. DeepSeek keys, raw HealthKit data, and iCloud credentials are never included."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key 只保存在本机 Keychain，不进入 iCloud Keychain、日志、备份或版本归档。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is stored only in the local Keychain and is excluded from iCloud Keychain, logs, backups, and release archives."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 可查看同步后的营养条目和热量平衡。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac can view synced nutrition entries and energy balance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 查看 iPhone 通过 CloudKit 同步的每日活动、静息和总消耗汇总。当前构建尚未配置真实 CloudKit 容器时，数据仅保存在本机。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac displays daily active, resting, and total burn summaries synced from iPhone through CloudKit. Until a live CloudKit container is configured, data remains on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Food Facts 依 ODbL 归属使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Food Facts is used with ODbL attribution"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "USDA FoodData Central 公共领域种子数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "USDA FoodData Central public-domain seed data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Sync"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 账号已变化。确认前不会上传上一账号的数据，也不会自动合并到新账号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your iCloud account changed. Nothing is uploaded or merged into the new account until you confirm."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一张餐食照片的结构化分析": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Structured analysis of a meal photo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
