    "使用 Apple 本机识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Apple on-device recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 CKSyncEngine 和私有自定义 Zone 同步日记、自定义食物、复合食物、每日能量汇总与目标。照片、DeepSeek Key、健康和语言偏好不进入 CloudKit。离线修改保留在本机并等待下一次同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CKSyncEngine and a private custom zone sync diary entries, custom foods, composite foods, daily energy summaries, and goals. Photos, the DeepSeek key, health data, and language preferences never enter CloudKit. Offline changes stay on this device and wait for the next sync."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用 DeepSeek 识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
