    "允许把照片估算值写入 Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow photo estimates to be written to Health"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先拍一张全景，再补充近景。识别只提供菜品、份量或标签信息，必须由你确认后才计入营养。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a full view first, then close-ups. Recognition only suggests dishes, portions, or label information; nothing counts until you confirm it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "克": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
