    "包装营养标签识别需要配置 DeepSeek Vision": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Packaged nutrition-label recognition requires DeepSeek Vision"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "包装食品": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Packaged food"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "包装食品在线数据使用 ODbL；需要保留归属，公开分发改编数据库时须遵守相同方式共享。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online packaged-food data uses ODbL. Attribution is required, and adapted databases distributed publicly must use the same license."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "匹配食物": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Matched food"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "历史": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "History"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送照片到 DeepSeek？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send photos to DeepSeek?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删除当前设备的饮食记录、自定义食物、目标、汇总、冲突副本和本地照片；Health App 中已写入的膳食样本不会自动删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes meal records, custom foods, goals, summaries, conflict copies, and local photos on this device only. Dietary samples already written to Apple Health are not deleted automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可导入食物": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importable foods"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可改用 DeepSeek 云端识别，照片只会在你每次确认后上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can use DeepSeek cloud recognition; photos are uploaded only after your confirmation each time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可食比例": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Edible ratio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台湾 FDA 数据采用政府资料开放授权条款；USDA FoodData Central 数据为公共领域。App 只读使用打包目录，不上传查询内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taiwan FDA data uses the Open Government Data License; USDA FoodData Central data is public domain. The app reads the bundled catalog locally and does not upload queries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "台湾参考名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taiwan reference names"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合并恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge restore"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合并恢复会保留较新的本机记录并将冲突写入冲突副本；完整替换会先删除当前设备上的饮食数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
