    "本地数据库无法打开。现有文件不会被自动删除。可以先重试；只有确认后才允许重建本地数据库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The local database could not be opened. Existing files are not deleted automatically. Retry first; rebuilding requires explicit confirmation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地机器翻译": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local machine translations"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机删除会移除当前设备的饮食记录、自定义食物、目标、汇总、同步元数据、冲突副本和本地照片。删除 iCloud 数据会同时删除当前私有 CloudKit Zone；Health App 中已写入的膳食样本不会自动删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deleting local data removes this device’s diary entries, custom foods, goals, summaries, sync metadata, conflict copies, and local photos. Deleting iCloud data also removes the private CloudKit zone. Meals already written to the Health app are not deleted automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本构建已建立本地持久化和同步冲突模型；接入真实 iCloud 容器后，由 CKSyncEngine 同步非照片数据与每日能量汇总。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build provides local persistence and a sync-conflict model. Once a live iCloud container is connected, CKSyncEngine will sync non-photo data and daily energy summaries."
          }
        }
      }
    },
