            "value": "No entries"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "活动、静息和锻炼时间按来源分别选择，不会把多个设备相加。App 仅在前台、回到前台或 HealthKit 数据变化时刷新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Active energy, resting energy, and exercise time are selected per source and are never summed across devices. The app refreshes in the foreground, on return to foreground, or after HealthKit changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "活动净平衡": {
      "localizations": {
