            "value": "Test saved key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "混合餐识别只提取菜品、食材和份量，营养由本地目录计算。包装标签识别会提取可见营养数值，并保持“估算”状态等待确认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mixed-meal recognition extracts only dishes, ingredients, and portions; nutrition is calculated from the local catalog. Label recognition extracts visible values and keeps them estimated until confirmation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
